      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I experience this as well for my world and test world as well as it affects older worlds. Newer worlds seem to do fine when creating for the 1st time, but doesn't work when updating the world, thus leaving them in the dark to rot away. So within the time frame, it seems the SDK broke adding the recently updated time out of the API Update when pushing a world.\n\nMain World ID: wrld_d0cb414b-eae5-4ba7-b800-26bd0e5bacb9\nLast Update according to API: 04/14/2019\nLast Official Update To World: 05/31/2019\n\n----\n\nTest World ID: wrld_77c5de00-a973-4f76-b97f-b0d01ed037d8\nLast Update according to API: 05/23/2019\nLast Official Update To World: 07/12/2019",
      "viewerReactions": null
